@host = http://localhost:5080
@unknownProductId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Unknown product
POST {{host}}/catalog/products/{{unknownProductId}}/publish

### A draft created with zero price cannot be published
POST {{host}}/catalog/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Unpriced product", "description": "Draft", "price": 0 }
